    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c47d397ade2a4389b8133b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，“惰性”状态持续的话……\n从“相位差”“连结”会变得困难……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cbb22743a7e50d0aae63ba884e5d048eeb6dc7efd45697e5676569c32517131",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105714.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434fccdcbffab234b8ba6b9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的意思似乎是……\n休息太久的话训练进度会落后，\n在比赛上进行“连结”的难度也会提高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "817d3b28cb49be2fb09ae1bb4ca73544fc5f1c1b4ea0b8708af90f735f4fad86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105714.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7876192f9593392768de0a72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
