    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90bca71698167a7052f4ef64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙似乎想要减轻训练强度，\n持续训练的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a94c6db0b0e679a0fd568b6ec80b268f866b35f321a6881a9180ece80b362eb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105714.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e525c75bf3413f21c6d73e43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不能忽视伤势恶化，\n状况变得难以挽回的可能性。\n于是我说服她现在不要着急，慢慢疗伤。",
